				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "##Focal Point for Dedicated Projects\r\nThe Hub is a *Top Level* oversight mechanism and so it provides an interface for other dedicated projects built upon Pharo or GT to manage their own interface at this level.\n\nFor example, the ability for {{gtClass:Hub}} to provide an oversight of the system through browsing GT, can be easily adopted by any and all other projects, in any smalltalk that supports Pragma annotations.\n\nAt startup time  {{gtMethod:Hub class>>startUp}}  an auction selects the most suitable class to be  {{gtMethod:Hub class>>current}} .   Subclasses can override {{gtMethod:Hub class>>onStartUpBidToBeBrowser}} to outbid {{gtMethod:GlamorousˆHub class>>onStartUpBidToBeBrowser}}  if they wish to be in control."
			}
		]
	},
